# 8. Sketch with the mouse

In this example, strokes are drawn with the mouse on a sheet. The demo has its own keys (undo, clear, change
of color), and the slide has buttons for the same actions. The point of the example is the keyboard: the keys
of the demo must not take the keys of the presentation.

